vert program) Display the thumbnail to the user (using the Linux command-line display program) Ask the user whether or not it should be rotated; if so, do it. (using the Linux command-line convert program) Ask the user for a caption, and collect it. Generate a properly oriented half-size version of the photo (using the Linux command-line convert program) When done, the program should leave the following in the directory in which it was invoked. (That is, if you were in foo/ when you invoked album, then all these things go into foo/) a file index.html containing, for each photo: a properly oriented thumbnail a caption a link from the thumbnail to a properly oriented medium-size version of the photo the thumbnails and medium-size versions.","topics":[],"score":1917,"global_rank":349843},{"name":"nfarah86/nodemcu-project","owner":"nfarah86","html_url":"https://github.com/nfarah86/nodemcu-project","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Arduino","description":"This is a quick project that uses NodeMCU with platform.io and coolterm. ","topics":[],"score":1917,"global_rank":349844},{"name":"KyleJShaver/Coral-Finance","owner":"KyleJShaver","html_url":"https://github.com/KyleJShaver/Coral-Finance","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Objective-C","description":"My team's Second-Place submission to CSUN App Jam 2015","topics":[],"score":1917,"global_rank":349846},{"name":"leakingtapan/reactive-design-patterns","owner":"leakingtapan","html_url":"https://github.com/leakingtapan/reactive-design-patterns","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Scala","description":"Sample Code for reactive design patterns book","topics":[],"score":1917,"global_rank":349858},{"name":"galenscovell/Hinterstar","owner":"galenscovell","html_url":"https://github.com/galenscovell/Hinterstar","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Scala","description":"Space Roguelite for Android","topics":[],"score":1917,"global_rank":349861},{"name":